# Feed reconciliation flow skeleton (pseudo)

FLOW ReconcileFeedInboxFlow(scan_time: timestamp) {
  STEP 1: scan outbox events with status FAILED or long-time PENDING
  STEP 2: for each event, verify whether enough FeedInbox rows were produced
  STEP 3: if rows missing, replay fan-out in idempotent chunk mode
  STEP 4: mark event as SUCCEEDED when replay completes
  STEP 5: send unresolved events to manual inspection queue after max retry
}
